Baked to perfection with real beef, Blue Buffalo BLUE Bones dog biscuits are ideal everyday treats for small dogs. As a healthy but delicious take on the classic bone-shaped treat, they feature the finest natural ingredients and are free of chicken (or poultry) by-product meals, corn, wheat, soy, artificial flavors and preservatives. Your best pal will crunch, wag and repeat! 

• BAKED WITH REAL BEEF: These deliciously crunchy dog biscuits are loaded with real beef in every bite; 

• CLASSIC BONE-SHAPED BISCUITS: Our healthy take on the classic treat BLUE Bones are shaped like a bone and baked with wholesome ingredients for a crunch dogs love; 

• NATURAL INGREDIENTS: BLUE Bones feature healthy natural ingredients including real meat and wholesome whole grains so you can feel good about giving them every day; 

• HEALTHY INGREDIENTS ONLY: BLUE Bones dog treats don’t contain any BHA or meat and bone meal and have NO artificial preservatives; 

• INCLUDED IN PACKAGE: contains one (1) 12-oz. bag of BLUE Bones Natural Crunchy Biscuits Mini Beef Dog Treats

• ENHANCED IMAGERY: We have enhanced our digital product packaging to highlight our products’ ingredients and essential benefits. While the physical packaging will differ slightly, all information is accurate
